          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 147877,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Los juegos más grandes agrupan valores similares, como los enemigos en un nivel.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   .gridContainer {&#xA;    display: grid;&#xA;    grid-row-gap: 10px;&#xA;    grid-template-columns: 300px;&#xA;    grid-template-rows: 140px 50px 50px 50px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   .gridItem {&#xA;    background-color: white;&#xA;    border: 1px;&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    padding-top: 5px;&#xA;    padding-left: 10px;&#xA;    font-size: 20px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   .gridItem.slime {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;    grid-column-start: 1;&#xA;    grid-column-end: 2;&#xA;    grid-row-start: 2;&#xA;    grid-row-end: 3;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   .gridItem.bat {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;    grid-column-start: 1;&#xA;    grid-column-end: 2;&#xA;    grid-row-start: 3;&#xA;    grid-row-end: 4;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   .gridItem.goblin {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;    grid-column-start: 1;&#xA;    grid-column-end: 2;&#xA;    grid-row-start: 4;&#xA;    grid-row-end: 5;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   body {&#xA;    background-color: #bfdaf9;&#xA;    display: flex;&#xA;    justify-content: center;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   .gridItem img {&#xA;    float: left;&#xA;    height: 30px;&#xA;    width: 30px;&#xA;    margin-right: 10px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   p {&#xA;    margin: 0px;&#xA;    font-size: 25px;&#xA;    padding-top: 7px;&#xA;    color: #3e416d;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   #playerDiv {&#xA;    border: 1px;&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    background-color: white;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    display: block;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   #player {&#xA;    height: 137px;&#xA;    width: 137px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   #goblinIcon {&#xA;    height: 26px;&#xA;    width: 26px;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&quot;gridContainer&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div id=&quot;playerDiv&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/tom.png&quot; id=&quot;player&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div class=&quot;gridItem slime&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/elijah.png&quot;&gt;Slime&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div class=&quot;gridItem bat&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/portrait-cv.png&quot;&gt;Bat&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div class=&quot;gridItem goblin&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/lee.png&quot; id=&quot;goblinIcon&quot;&gt;Goblin&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script src=&quot;script.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 147878,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crear una variable para cada enemigo haría que tu código fuera largo y complejo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy3 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>enemy1</code> seguido de <code>enemy2</code> y finalmente <code>enemy3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147879,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>En lugar de crear una variable para cada enemigo, podemos agrupar todos los valores en un <strong>array</strong> usando <code>[</code> y <code>]</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>[</code> seguido de <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147880,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Los valores de un array se llaman <strong>elementos</strong>. Por ejemplo, <code>\"Slime\"</code>, <code>\"Bat\"</code> y <code>\"Goblin\"</code> son elementos de este array.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"41\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"Goblin\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147881,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para crear un array vacío, escribimos <code>[</code> y <code>]</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>[</code> seguido de <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147882,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Colocar una cadena entre los corchetes crea un array con un valor, pruébalo con <code>\"Slime\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"24\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"Slime\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147883,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usamos comas <code>,</code> para separar dos o más valores en un array, como <code>\"Slime\"</code> de <code>\"Bat\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147884,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cualquier cantidad de valores cabe en un array. Añadimos más codificando una coma y luego el valor.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"41\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>,</code> seguido de <code>\"Goblin\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 147885,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuáles son los símbolos para rodear valores en un array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[</code> y <code>]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>{</code> y <code>}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[</code> y <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 147886,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cómo llamamos a los valores de un array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">\"Elementos\"</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">\"Condiciones\"</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir \"Elementos\".</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 147887,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuántos valores tiene este array?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lootDrops = [];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">0</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir 0.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 147888,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué valor tiene este array?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Potion\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No tiene ningún valor</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"Potion\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 147889,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál es el símbolo para separar valores en un array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una coma <code>,</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un punto y coma <code>;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una coma <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 147890,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál es el número de valores que podemos almacenar en un array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tantos como nos gustaría</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">3</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tantos como nos gustaría.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 147891,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Asigna un array que contenga <code>\"Key\"</code> a la variable <code>items</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" items = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(items);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>[</code> seguido de <code>\"Key\"</code> y finalmente <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 147892,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Asigna un array vacío a la variable llamada <code>projectiles</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[&quot;Arrow&quot;]\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" projectiles = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(projectiles);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>[]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 147893,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una variable <code>activePlayers</code> que almacene un array con el valor <code>\"Player1\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Player2&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" activePlayers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Active:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(activePlayers);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>activePlayers</code> seguido de <code>[</code> y luego <code>\"Player1\"</code>, <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 147894,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un array con <code>\"coin\"</code> y luego <code>\"gem\"</code> como los dos últimos valores.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"47\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pickups = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;heart&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;star&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"coin\"</code> seguido de <code>,</code> y finalmente <code>\"gem\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #19",
            "id": 147895,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un array con dos valores codificando <code>, \"Shield\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"36\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" equipment = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(equipment);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>, \"Shield\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
